  "question": {
    "text": "The slope of tangent at any point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on a curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then a value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
